{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>Multiplayer Vehicle Combat game. Set in chaotic 2041, you are one of a few, who can experience \u201cThe Program\u201d. All Around Reality Show, which takes place in the Machine Challenger arena.<br><br>It will include arena and racing types of gameplay. Multiplayer and single-player modes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/b93cd5483c91e5bddfeaa0a24f7039dd.poster.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/b93cd5483c91e5bddfeaa0a24f7039dd.webm?t=1756584043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/b93cd5483c91e5bddfeaa0a24f7039dd.mp4?t=1756584043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chose Your Style </h2>The heavier the vehicle, the slower its speed, making it an easier target for others in the arena. However, its robust armor allows it to withstand more hits compared to lighter, faster vehicles with less protection. Choose your combat style wisely: opt for more armor for durability, prioritize speed for agility, or find a balance between the two. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/88c98106c5552c2e05118a614a3838c8.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=330 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/3f5bd3befb8e08e683b2e8187e554cbd.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=330 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle customization</h2>Love customizing your ride? Head to the garage and explore our wide range of cosmetic customization options to give your vehicle a unique and stylish makeover. Whether it's vibrant colors, striking decals, or sleek finishes, the choice is yours. Start with a base model at Tier One and elevate it to Tier 3, creating a standout masterpiece on the track.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/03d6ad55a7b512afbaf4ac34ec36ec24.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=330 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Different Modes</h2>We don't want you getting bored with just one mode in our car combat game. It can become monotonous quickly, and that's not what we aim for. Our game offers various modes to keep things exciting. Whether you prefer races with or without guns, team battles, Capture the Flag, King of the Hill, or even some hidden modes, we've got you covered. After all, it's all about having fun, right?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/a444492eeb8ffb39631e58c8c8bda01d.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=330 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/33a449f14dd8324169518b1aec3ac829.poster.avif?t=1756584043\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/33a449f14dd8324169518b1aec3ac829.webm?t=1756584043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/extras/33a449f14dd8324169518b1aec3ac829.mp4?t=1756584043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2576290?t=1756584043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756584043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/d4e25593ef0dca0f1941e84d25caf08779051fa0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756584043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576290/d4e25593ef0dca0f1941e84d25caf08779051fa0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756584043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game features some mature content, including the depiction of characters in sexy outfits and with curvy body types to enhance their visual appeal. While these elements are designed to make the characters visually appealing, they are presented tastefully and are not explicit in nature.\r\nAdditionally, our game storyline may touch upon themes that some players may find sensitive, such as depictions of romantic relationships, adventure, and competition. We do not include depictions of sexual assault/non-consensual sex or self-harm in our storyline.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the visual content, alcohol usage might be occasionally shown in our trailer videos and could be mentioned in character dialogue within the game. However, we do not depict excessive or irresponsible alcohol consumption."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>Multiplayer Vehicle Combat game. Set in chaotic 2041, you are one of a few, who can experience \u201cThe Program\u201d. All Around Reality Show, which takes place in the Machine Challenger arena.<br><br>It will include arena and racing types of gameplay. Multiplayer and single-player modes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi